(6815140, 1023755, 108982, '<td valign="top">I think that some folks are so locked into thinking that ''abstract'' ONLY means blurred or distorted.  It also encompasses things like this where the background is essentially non-existent lending an odd sense of displacement or other-worldliness.  It pains me when people say things to the effect of IMHO DNMC.  As much as their interpretation flavors THEIR submissions, your interpretation flavors YOURS.  This photo is so much better than the score.</td>', 'I think that some folks are so locked into thinking that ''abstract'' ONLY means blurred or distorted.  It also encompasses things like this where the background is essentially non-existent lending an odd sense of displacement or other-worldliness.  It pains me when people say things to the effect of IMHO DNMC.  As much as their interpretation flavors THEIR submissions, your interpretation flavors YOURS.  This photo is so much better than the score.', '2012-07-11 01:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
