(6815372, 1023755, 117474, '<td valign="top">1.262 times more asigmaticly chaotic than the rest!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a> <br/> <br/>Reminds me of a rhyme my primary school teacher used to say long time ago:<br/>"Spring is sprung. The grass is riz. I wonder where the birdie is. <br/>The bird they said is on the wing. Ain''t that absurd. From what I heard, the wing is in the bird."<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-07-11 19:10:13.</i></td>', '1.262 times more asigmaticly chaotic than the rest!  Reminds me of a rhyme my primary school teacher used to say long time ago:"Spring is sprung. The grass is riz. I wonder where the birdie is. The bird they said is on the wing. Ain''t that absurd. From what I heard, the wing is in the bird."', '2012-07-11 10:34:06.000000', '2012-07-11 20:10:13.000000', 0),
