(6818470, 1024242, 31456, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kasaba:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a really cool image, but I am obviously seriously unimaginative these days ... I still haven''t figured out what it is. Can you put me out of my misery? (and yes, I have read all the comments and I have read something about a "leg", and I still can''t see it :-(). The best I can see is a "cat" ...?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Black piece at the top-left seems to be the bottom part of a jacket.<br/>Going down from there, there''s a thigh oriented straight down the left edge of the image.<br/>Further down, the knee... and the bottom part of the leg goes toward the middle of the image, ending in a dark (black?) shoe.</td>', 'Originally posted by kasaba: This is a really cool image, but I am obviously seriously unimaginative these days ... I still haven''t figured out what it is. Can you put me out of my misery? (and yes, I have read all the comments and I have read something about a "leg", and I still can''t see it :-(). The best I can see is a "cat" ...??  Black piece at the top-left seems to be the bottom part of a jacket.Going down from there, there''s a thigh oriented straight down the left edge of the image.Further down, the knee... and the bottom part of the leg goes toward the middle of the image, ending in a dark (black?) shoe.', '2012-07-15 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
